OL,3,AAdjusting triple lock to fund social
OL,4,Acare 'is about helping pensioners',
OL,5,ABurnham says, as Tories criticise plan
OL,6,
OL,7,FAdjusting triple lock to fund social
OL,8,Fcare 'is about helping pensioners',
OL,9,FBurnham says, as Tories criticise plan
OL,11,FHe also says rejoining the EU is among
OL,12,Foptions the government could look at -
OL,13,Fand that Brexit has caused "more harm
OL,14,Fthan good"
OL,16,FIt comes after the PM's conference
OL,17,Fspeech on Tuesday, in which he said his
OL,18,Fgovernment will end the existing triple
OL,19,Flock on state pensions from 2030 to
OL,20,Fhelp fund social care reforms in
OL,21,FEngland
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
